    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-iudic15">
        <head xml:id="gom-iudic15-Hd1e98">Caput 15</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-iudic15-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-iudic15-Hd1e102">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iudic15-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic15-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iudic15_8@1-2">Percussitque eos,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-iudic15-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-iudic15-Nd1e110" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name>, quaest. 55 in Jud.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic15-Qd1e114">LXX: Percussit alienigenas Samson ad <pb ed="#P" n="0532A"/> tibiam super femur, id est, tam mirabiliter, ut stupentes tibiam unius pedis super femur alterius ponerent.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iudic15-Dd1e121">
          <head xml:id="gom-iudic15-Hd1e123">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iudic15-d1e125">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic15-Qd1e127" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iudic15_12@10-10">Jurate.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iudic15-Rd1e130"><name xml:id="gom-iudic15-Nd1e131" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name>, quaest. 56 in Jud.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic15-Qd1e135"><seg type="qs">Quid est quod ait Samson viris Juda</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">nisi audiendo vel legendo discantur, ita nec modi locutionum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iudic15-Dd1e144">
          <head xml:id="gom-iudic15-Hd1e146">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iudic15-d1e148">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic15-Qd1e150" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iudic15_16@3-4">In maxilla.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iudic15-Rd1e153"><name xml:id="gom-iudic15-Nd1e154" ref="#GregoryGreat">GREG.</name>, lib. XIII Moral., cap. 6.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic15-Qd1e158">Maxilla asini praedicatores significat. Redemptor enim noster simplicitatem et patientiam praedicantium, suae manu virtutis tenens, a vitiis carnales interfecit, et maxilla in terram projecta, postmodum aquas fudit: quia tradita morti praedicatorum corpora magna populis monstravere miracula.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
